                    "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
                        "\n###  Clear\n\n **Identifier**: `TLP:CLEAR`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\nRecipients can spread this to the world, there is no limit on disclosure.\n",
                        "\n###  Green\n\n **Identifier**: `TLP:GREEN`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\nLimited disclosure, recipients can spread this within their community. Sources may use TLP:GREEN when information is useful to increase awareness within their wider community.\n",
                        "\n###  Amber\n\n **Identifier**: `TLP:AMBER`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\nLimited disclosure, recipients can only spread this on a need-to-know basis within their organization and its clients.\n",
                        "\n###  Amber+Strict\n\n **Identifier**: `TLP:AMBER+STRICT`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\nSimilar to TLP:AMBER, but restricts sharing to the organization only.\n",
                        "\n###  Red\n\n **Identifier**: `TLP:RED`\n\n_Vocabulary_ : `Traffic Light Protocol`\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\nFor the eyes and ears of individual recipients only, no further disclosure.\n"
                    ],
